 Dog Park\n\n**WHEN**: Saturday\, 17 Oct. Gather at 2PM. Hare away at 2:30P
 M.\n\n**HARE**: The National Pornographic\n\n**HASH CASH**: $8\n\n**SHIGGY
  LEVE**L: 69\n\n**DETAILS / VIBE**: 69\, 66\, 99\, 34.5...\n\nNational Por
 nographic is creeping up on the age he looks. So\, this creepy and pervert
 ed hasher wishes to celebrate with an old-school hash. This means leaving 
 your inhibitions and morals at home\, accepting that it may get "rowdy!" L
