X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Highland Brewing": "https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/pleasure-chest-2/", "Where Y'at AVL Music": "https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/pleasure-chest-2/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Highlandbrewing": "https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/pleasure-chest-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:highlandbrewing
X-SOURCE:Highland Brewing, Where Y'at AVL Music
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T210000
DTSTAMP:20260913T174241Z
CREATED:20260913T174241Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260913T174241Z
UID:10029847-1792263600-1792270800@highlandbrewing.com
SUMMARY:Pleasure Chest
DESCRIPTION:Pleasure Chest is a band that plays Blues\, Soul and Rock and Roll from Asheville\, North Carolina\n\n\n\n\n\n\nWeekend Live Music\nHighland Brewing’s weekend live music series showcases incredible local talent\, regional acts and national touring bands from across the East Coast and beyond. Free and open to all ages (unless noted otherwise)\, it’s the perfect excuse to gather your crew\, listen and vibe to a wide range of genres including soul\, bluegrass\, acoustic\, country\, folk and more.\nLive music typically takes place on our scenic Meadow stage. Shows are rain or shine\, if the weather doesn’t cooperate and we have time to move inside\, the band will play in the Taproom where there’s still plenty of room to boogie.\nChairs\, blankets and well-behaved\, leashed pets are welcome in the Meadow. Please note that coolers and outside alcohol are not permitted on the premises.
URL:https://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/pleasure-chest-2/
LOCATION:Meadow at Highland Brewing Co.\, 12 Old Charlotte Highway\, Suite 200\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://highlandbrewing.com/wp-content/uploads/pleasurechest.jpeg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Avl Digital Nomads": "https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/316766797/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_avl_digital_nomads
X-SOURCE:AVL Digital Nomads
UID:event_316766797@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T040943Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T230000
SUMMARY:BlueSmokeAVL Monthly Blues Dance
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nBlueSmoke is Asheville’s home for tradit
 ional blues dancing\, a space to move\, connect\, and get lost in the musi
 c.\nEach month\, on the 3rd Saturday\, we gather to explore the roots of b
 lues through dance\, starting with an accessible lesson and followed by a 
 social dance open to all levels. Whether you're brand new or have been dan
 cing for years\, you’re welcome here.\nCome as you are. Bring your curio
 sity\, your rhythm\, and your love of blues music.\n\nSocial dancing is a 
 great way for introverts to socialize because you can connect with people 
 without a lot of small talk. Also great for extroverts because it is like 
 a party.\n\nNo partner required- bring a friend or make them there (or bot
 h). We all dance with everyone as well as solo.\nContinuing class 7- 7:45\
 nFundamentals 7:45-8:30\nOpen dance 8:30-11\nMusic curated by local DJs\n\
 n$15 cash or venmo at the door\n\\- volunteer= free admission\n\nWear some
 thing comfortable and shoes that slide (leather-soled if you have them)\nB
 ring water and any snacks you may need for the evening.\nCheck out BlueSmo
 keAVL on the socials for more FAQs
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/316766797/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260929T170621Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929T170621Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
