X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Avl Digital Nomads": "https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/316963438/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_avl_digital_nomads
X-SOURCE:AVL Digital Nomads
UID:event_316963438@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261017T040943Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261020T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261020T180000
SUMMARY:Fractional Professional Life
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**Fractional Executives Connect — Managi
 ng Change Management**\nChange is inevitable in business. Leading people t
 hrough it successfully is a different skill.\n\nJoin a casual\, engaging m
 eetup to explore the real world challenges of Change Management. An open c
 onversation focused on practical experiences\, shared insights and lessons
  learned from leading change within organizations.\n\nFrom shifting priori
 ties and evolving team dynamics to implementing new processes and navigati
 ng uncertainty\, we’ll discuss what it takes to move from resistance to 
 alignment and from disruption to meaningful progress.\n\nConnect with othe
 r Fractional Executives\, exchange perspectives\, and leave with fresh ide
 as you can apply in your own business.\n\n**Who this is for:** Active frac
 tional executives currently serving one or more clients\, Fractional COOs\
 , CFOs\, CMOs\, CHROs\, CTOs\, CROs\, and beyond.\n\n📅 Tuesday\, Octobe
 r 20\n🕓4:00–6:00 PM\n\nPizza\, snacks and beverages (alcoholic and no
 n-alcoholic) will be available for purchase on site.\n\nSpace will be kept
  intentionally small to keep the conversation real. Please complete the re
 gistration form so we can understand who will be there and build programmi
 ng that will fit the group.\n\n**Thinking about going fractional but haven
 't landed your first client yet?** ***Hang tight***\, we're planning a sep
 arate event just for the fractionally curious later this year. This gather
 ing is reserved for practitioners already in it.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/316963438/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261013T183628Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261013T183628Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
