SUMMARY:AVL Digital Nomads | Travel Talk
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nCalling all travel lovers! AVL Digital Nom
 ads is starting a travel series\, and this month we're focused on YOU\, th
 e people in the room.\n\nJoin us for rapid-fire get-to-know you rounds to 
 intentionally talk about travel. Chat with someone new to swap stories\, f
 ind out where they've been\, what's on their list\, and whether your trave
 l styles click. You'll have \\~10 minutes to talk\, then we rotate so you 
 can meet someone new. We'll do a few rounds\, then settle in and hang out 
 for the rest of the evening. Think of this less like a formal event and mo
 re like finding your new travel buddies or friends with great recs.\n​\n
 **A heads up:** ​We'll be using a new platform built for travelers like 
 you\, called **Stravvy**\, to facilitate the session. We suggest setting u
 p a quick traveler profile before the event so you're ready to hit the gro
 und running (takes \\~5 min). Folks who RSVP will receive an invite link a
 head of the event\, se be sure to register and keep an eye on your inbox!\
 n​As always\, AVL Digital Nomads is free to attend and new faces are alw
 ays welcome. Feel free to invite a friend!\n\n​Questions? Reach out to [
 jessica@travelstravvy.com](mailto:jessica@travelstravvy.com "mailto:jessic
 a@travelstravvy.com")
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/316926520/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261010T193032Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261010T193032Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
