DESCRIPTION:Martie Schoener will be leading Functional Mobility Yoga a sea
 ted yoga for all ages and abilities.Functional mobility yogafocuses on imp
 roving the body’s ability to move efficiently and effectively in daily l
 ife\, rather than just increasing flexibility.It emphasizes strengthening 
 muscles that support joints and engaging core muscles to improve stability
  and coordination.This approach is valuable because it helps prevent injur
 ies by building strength around vulnerable areas and promotes better po
