SUMMARY:Pisgah Legal’s 15th Annual Justice Forum with Brian Goldstone
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261022T170000
UID:2427a047039ef73c5219439894acd703@ashevillechamber.org
DESCRIPTION:Pisgah Legal’s 15th Annual Justice Forum will be held at the
  Thomas Wolfe Auditorium in downtown Asheville on Thursday\, October 22. A
  ticketed pre-event reception will begin at 5:30 p.m.\, followed by the fr
 ee Justice Forum at 7:00 p.m. The Forum is free and open to the public\, w
 ith options to attend in person\, via livestream\, or at one of several Re
 gional Watch Parties in communities across Western North Carolina. Registr
