SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ DJ Esmæ (Megan Belling)
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, October 23rd\nEvening 
 Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nF
 acilitator DJ Esmæ (Megan Belling)\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About DJ Esmæ
  (Megan Belling)\n\nDJ Esmæ has been moving in the world of ecstatic danc
 e for over 13 years and sharing musical journeys as a DJ for the past 5. H
 er sets weave together tribal rhythm\, texture\, intensity\, and softness 
 in a way that invites people back into their heart and home space.\nListen
  to her mixes at: https://soundcloud.com/djesmae\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Pl
 ease note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Op
 ening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time
  to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 o
 r name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registrat
 ion Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance 
 for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.
 org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=
 IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3
 ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA
 _aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will clos
 e at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPEN
 ING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemoveme
 ntcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-d
 ance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2l
 kEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3
 ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movemen
 t Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to
  be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim 
 are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through free-form dance 
 by hosting dance waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a
  501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, N
 C 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
