SUMMARY:Cocktail Comedy: Vodka Be Kidding
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Comedy Fans\nModelface Comedy Club brings the best c
 omedians from all over the country to Asheville\, NC.\nChemist Spirts welc
 omes top comedians for a night of comedy so good you'll be say "Vodka Be K
