SUMMARY:Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ Ted Riskin
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, October 30th\nEvening 
 Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nF
 acilitator Ted Riskin\n\nIntention: TBA\n\n## About Ted Riskin\n\nTed is i
 nterested in anything that can get him out of his head\, and music and mov
 ement do a pretty good job of that. He hopes to offer music that facilitat
 es an inner journey and invitations that create a shift. While he likes mo
 dern electronic music\, he can’t create a mix without including lots of 
 natural instruments and voices. Due to a short attention span\, he mixes i
 n lots of different musical genres. You can hear some of his mixes on [htt
 ps://www.mixcloud.com/tarisk/](https://www.mixcloud.com/tarisk/)\n\n\\~\\~
 \\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up. The doors clos
 e promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will be turned away. P
 lease be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Pri
 ces: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds
 !\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volu
 nteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemov
 ementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/vo
 lunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBw
 X2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2
 I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n
 \nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circle. Please note: NO 
 ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https:/
 /ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcoll
 ective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN
 0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb
 _LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nA
 sheville Movement Collective envisions a world that moves in harmony where
  all are free to be their authentic selves within a loving community. Our 
 mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy community through 
 free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and community transfor
 mation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd
 \, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
