 !**\n**Sorry ~ no guests allowed since I’m limited in how many attendees
  I can have at the restaurant.**\n\n**MENU/WEBSITE:** **www.westfirstwoodf
 ired.com**\n**They have gluten-free\, vegetarian and vegan options. They a
 lso offer a full-service bar. 🍕🍷 🍺**\n\n**PARKING: 🅿️** **Co
 me a little early to find a parking place. It can be challenging. 🚗 
 🚙**\n\n**PETS: 🐶** **Sorry\, no pets are allowed. 😞**\n\n**TABLE 
 RESERVATIONS:** **🍽️** **We have table reservations for a party of 12
  on Halloween/Saturday - October 31 at 12:30 PM.**\n\n**HALLOWEEN COSTUMES
 : It’s Halloween so dress up if you like. Not mandatory\, but it would b
 e fun! 🤩 🧛👻 I am!**\n\n**NOTE: There will be a Treat Street Carni
 val on Main Street from 2PM - 5PM if you would like to see the cute kids i
 n Halloween costumes! At 3:00PM there will be a costume contest in front o
 f the historic courthouse which is only 48 feet (literally!) ~ a 1-minute 
 walk ~ from the restaurant where we will be having lunch. So check it out!
  🧛👻🤩🥸 For more info: https://www.hendersoncountync.gov/recreat
 ion/page/treat-street-2026.**\n\n**HAPPY HALLOWEEN!!🎃 👻🧛‍♀️
