DESCRIPTION:PlayYourCourt Asheville Tennis\nWe’re still working to get m
 ore people into these Meetups\, but our goal is to give PlayYourCourt memb
 ers a few social tennis outings each week in addition to your practice ses
 sions and Challenge League matches.\n\nThese Meetups are co-ed\, super lai
 d back\, and all skill levels are welcome. Post your skill level and a sug
 gested court in the comments section so we can round up as many players as
