SUMMARY: Calvary Food Pantry
DESCRIPTION:About the Calvary Food Pantry https://www.calvaryfletcher.org
 /about-our-pantry\n\nFresh veggies\, milk\, eggs\, canned\, dry and froze
 n options. Food assistance is available to anyone who seeks help.\n\nPant
 ry normally operates on a “neighbor’s choice” model\, where neighbors are
  offered the opportunity to choose from a variety of foods within specifi
 c categories.\n\nPhone number: (828) 684-6266\n\nEmail: foodpantry@calvar
