BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ncarboretum": "https://ncarboretum.org/event/hh-clay-gingerbread-creatures/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ncarboretum
X-SOURCE:NC Arboretum
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261113T140000
DTSTAMP:20261002T211234Z
CREATED:20261002T211234Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261002T211234Z
UID:1778780020229-1794567600-1794578400@ncarboretum.org
SUMMARY:Handmade Holiday: Clay Gingerbread Cookie Creatures
DESCRIPTION:Handmade Holiday: Clay Gingerbread Cookie Creatures\nwith Eileen Bos \nFriday\, November 13  |  11 am – 2 pm \nRegister Here!\nUsing Sculpey Polymer Clay\, we will soften and roll the clay out with a rolling pin\, and use gingerbread cookie cutters to begin our creature creations… each cookie creature will have hand painted glass eyes to install\, and we will use pre-colored polymer clay to add decorations\, creating buttons & details to help bring them to life! They can be made into ornaments\, magnets\, pins\, etc. They can even sit upright & be glued to the top of a cookie jar for future Christmas cookies! All materials will be included in this class. \nEileen Bos is a multimedia sculpture artist from NY\, with nearly 40 years of self-taught art experience. She began drawing at the age of 3 and sculpting at age 4. She has competed in The Nickle City cake Challenge\, was featured on the cover of Buffalo Magazine\, won several tablescape awards at Bride’s World Events\, showcased in an ad in NYC’s Times Square\, and much more! Along with art\, Eileen has a deep love of Quantum Sciences & Metaphysics and is working on developing art classes that fuse hands-on arts with Metaphysical principles to help people learn\, heal & grow in exciting\, multifaceted ways. You can find her work at: www.enchantedartwork.com. \n●  Members: Remember to enter your promo code upon checkout to receive your 10% member discount! Email adulteducation@ncarboretum.org with questions. \n●  See a full listing of Adult Education Programs at the North Carolina Arboretum here! Questions? Check our FAQs. \n●  We are committed to fostering a diverse\, supportive learning community. If the cost of a class is a barrier for you\, please complete this scholarship form and we will see what kind of assistance we can provide. \n●  Follow us on Facebook & Instagram! \n●  Join our Adult Education Student Hub on Discord! \n●  Interested in supporting the NC Arboretum more directly? Donate to the ONE Fund here. \nSee all of our classes open for registration here!
URL:https://ncarboretum.org/event/hh-clay-gingerbread-creatures/
CATEGORIES:Adult Education
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncarboretum.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/pexels-monserratsoldu-19594933.jpg
END:VEVENT
