DESCRIPTION:**Cairo Jag** is a 3-piece\, psych rock and roll band from Ind
 ianapolis\, IN. Forming in 2017\, they quickly became a local staple in In
 dianapolis’ eclectic music scene. Overlapping influences that derive fro
 m punk\, rock\, soul and psychedelic music from the past and present\, the
 y’ve created their own brand of unhinged rock and roll.
