UID:tribe-10015089@weavervillenc.org
DESCRIPTION:9:30-11am Integrated Taoist Tai Chi ClassTaoist Tai Chi\, as i
 t was developed by Master Moy Lin Shin\, a Taoist monk\, is a moving medit
 ation\, which promotes physical\, mental and spiritual well-being. The pra
 ctice has been known to reduce stress and help one feel energetic\, balanc
 ed\, strong and flexible.About the Instructor:PatLuxhas been a practitione
 r of Taoist Tai Chi for years and an instructor since 2015. Her continuing
