SUMMARY:Sun Circle: Capricorn Season
DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nWhen the sun moves into a new sign an energetic sh
 ift occurs. Learning to connect\, listen\, and set intentions with the sun
  is a beautiful way to add ritual into your life.\nCapricorn season is fro
 m 12/21 - 1/19 and for this gathering we'll discuss the Astrological happe
 nings of the zodiac season and where it will impact you personally (birth 
 chart recommended not required).\nAs with all energetic shifts\, getting i
 nto your body is important. Together we'll ground into the energy through 
 meditation and somatic movement themed around the season.\nAccommodations/
 Modification will be made for ALL bodies\, come as you are.\nWe'll close o
 ut with time for journaling and optional sharing.\n\n***Bring:***\nComfort
 able clothes to move in\nJournal and pen\nBirth chart if you have it\nwate
 r bottle\n\nCash \\|\\| Venmo \\|\\| Card are all accepted at the door als
 o
