DESCRIPTION:MaggieCrisp leads Tuesday and Thursday morning strength-based 
 High Intensity Interval Training (aerobic intervals). This offering is gea
 red to meet the needs for all fitness levels. You should bring a mat and p
 lan to primarily engage in body weight exercises.The class is about 40 min
 utes\, and open to anyone 15+\, parental permission required for minors.Cl
